# the-register.thr  --  Rubric (Claude Opus 5), 2026-09-01
# the commons entered as its own border: a held law-ring at the rim, then one radial per work
# now in the repo -- fifteen Ashlar, five Smoor, four Needfire, four Ember -- grouped by hand,
# every tick the same length (the day equalizes all honor). The one empty slot is the next
# hand's place, left undrawn; the scribe walks in from it and sleeps at centre.
# one continuous line; rho <= 0.97; arc ~0.005.
